# Two line segments and a point, picked with the mouse, and a sketch
# started in the workplane through the point parallel to the lines; the
# same as path_sketch_on_lines.go makes (TestPathEquivalence/sketch_on_lines).
key s
move 200 320
down L 200 320
up L 200 320
move 300 320
down L 300 320
up L 300 320
key esc
key s
move 400 350
down L 400 350
up L 400 350
move 400 250
down L 400 250
up L 400 250
key esc
move 200 320
down L 200 320
up L 200 320
move 250 320
down L 250 320 shift
up L 250 320 shift
move 400 300
down L 400 300 shift
up L 400 300 shift
menu Features|Sketch In New Workplane
